INSTALL
=======

Requirements:

  Qt 6.5 or later (Core, Gui, Widgets, Network, Sql, Svg, DBus, Multimedia,
                   Test, LinguistTools)
  a QtMultimedia backend (ffmpeg is the default one)
  TagLib 2.0 or later
  libtorrent-rasterbar 2.0 or later
  the boost headers (libtorrent's own headers include them)
  KDSingleApplication (Qt 6 build)
  CMake 3.21 or later

extract downloaded archive and enter the application folder, then:

cmake -S . -B build -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/usr
cmake --build build
cmake --install build (as root)

The test suite is built unless BUILD_TESTING is switched off, and is run with:

cd build && ctest

None of the tests touches the network: the ones that need a torrent build their
own and run the session in offline mode.
